$ \(a + b\)\(a^2 - a b + b^2\)= a^3 + b^3 #h(2em) upright("(VI)") $

]
#blk[两项立方差公式][
$ \(a - b\)\(a^2 + a b + b^2\)= a^3 - b^3 #h(2em) upright("(VII)") $

]
#example[
计算：$ \(x + 1\)\(x^2 + 1 - x\)\,#h(2em)\(2 - 3 y\)\(4 + 9 y^2 + 6 y\) $

]
#solution[
$ \(x + 1\)\(x^2 + 1 - x\) & =\(x + 1\)\(x^2 - x + 1\)\
 & = x^3 + 1 $ $ \(2 - 3 y\)\(4 + 9 y^2 + 6 y\) & =\(2 - 3 y\)\(4 + 6 y + 9 y^2\)\
 & = 2^3 -\(3 y\)^3\
 & = 8 - 27 y^3 $

]
#example[
计算：$ \(x^5 + 1\)\(x^10 - x^5 + 1\)\,#h(2em)\(x^3 - 1\)\(x^9 + 1\)\(x^6 + x^3 + 1\) $

]
#solution[
$ \(x^5 + 1\)\(x^10 - x^5 + 1\) & =\(x^5\)^3 + 1^3\
 & = x^15 + 1 $ $ \(x^3 - 1\)\(x^9 + 1\)\(x^6 + x^3 + 1\) & =\[\(x^3 - 1\)\(x^6 + x^3 + 1\)\]\(x^9 + 1\)\
 & =\(x^9 - 1\)dot.op\(x^9 + 1\)\
 & =\(x^9\)^2 - 1^2 = x^18 - 1 $

]
